5572: If the last field were instead marked externally instantiated, the record would
5573: contain neither of the two coordinates that Theorem~\ref{thm:upload-or-archive-instantiation-boundary}
5574: requires.  That would add a support coordinate not present in the package,
5575: contradicting Theorem~\ref{thm:finite-coordinate-determination-boundary}.  Hence
5576: the only compatible normal form is the one displayed, and its consequence for
